<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gml:doc xmlns:gml="urn:x-gml:canonical"><gdoc><body><h1>State hints</h1>
<p>Normal text, then
<gml:in left="4" unit="ch" break="yes"/>indented in the middle of a paragraph
<gml:bf font="hi1" break="no"/>and a font change.
</p><p>The next paragraph inherits both.
</p><ul><li>an item
<gml:in left="6" unit="ch" delta="+2" break="yes"/>indented further inside the item
</li><li>the next item
</li></ul><gml:pf initial="yes" break="no"/><p>Font back,
<gml:in left="0" unit="ch" break="yes"/>margin back.
</p><xmp xml:space="preserve"><gml:fo fill="no" align="left" overdraw="extend" break="yes"/>  verbatim
<gml:fo fill="yes" align="justify" overdraw="extend" break="yes"/></xmp><gml:fo fill="no" align="left" overdraw="extend" break="yes"/><gml:tp action="set" stops="5ch 10ch" break="no"/><p>no fill
<gml:tp action="add" stops="20ch" break="no"/>with tabs
<gml:fo fill="yes" align="justify" overdraw="extend" break="yes"/></p><p>filled again
<gml:hy mode="on" break="no"/></p><p>hyphenation on
<gml:in left="1" unit="i" for="2" for-unit="i" temporary="yes" break="yes"/>temporary indent: an event
</p></body></gdoc></gml:doc>
